1
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Silent Storm]</font>

2
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:11,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Ouyang Xu.</font>

3
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Yan Ping'an.</font>

4
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:15,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Zhou Haiyang.</font>

5
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 3]</font>

6
00:02:32,470 --> 00:02:35,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, is this Mao?</font>

7
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'd like to print some magazines.</font>

8
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Money is no issue.</font>

9
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

10
00:02:41,750 --> 00:02:42,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got the wrong number.</font>

11
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Qiang, Mao]
Mao, don't worry.</font>

12
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qiang gave me your number.</font>

13
00:02:50,190 --> 00:02:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As I said, wrong number.</font>

14
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:55,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is it?</font>

15
00:02:57,400 --> 00:03:00,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lately, I just can't control my temper.</font>

16
00:03:00,750 --> 00:03:02,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any random person can call me.</font>

17
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A couple of days ago,</font>

18
00:03:03,750 --> 00:03:05,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone asked</font>

19
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if we print calendars.</font>

20
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, they ask about magazines.</font>

21
00:03:09,470 --> 00:03:11,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And they say money is no issue.</font>

22
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They talk a big game.</font>

23
00:03:12,910 --> 00:03:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Playing dumb.</font>

24
00:03:15,470 --> 00:03:16,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chunjiang Tax Bureau]
He said, "Wrong number."</font>

25
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:17,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's impossible.</font>

26
00:03:17,310 --> 00:03:20,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe your pronunciation
isn't quite right.</font>

27
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:22,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which part wasn't right?</font>

28
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:24,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should you sound sweeter?</font>

29
00:03:24,710 --> 00:03:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know, dragging it out.</font>

30
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao...</font>

31
00:03:28,910 --> 00:03:30,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did they get your number?</font>

32
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:34,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They said they're a friend of Qiang.</font>

33
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:38,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Call them back and ask the price.</font>

34
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been short on cash lately.</font>

35
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:46,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, hurry.</font>

36
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello? What is it, Mao?</font>

37
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to print magazines?</font>

38
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of magazines?</font>

39
00:03:55,870 --> 00:03:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What magazines?</font>

40
00:03:57,920 --> 00:03:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Commercial sales materials,
advertising materials]</font>

41
00:03:59,630 --> 00:04:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We want to print</font>

42
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some magazines in color.</font>

43
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:07,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Magazines in color?</font>

44
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't follow.</font>

45
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All our magazines come in color.</font>

46
00:04:09,710 --> 00:04:10,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What color do you want?</font>

47
00:04:12,470 --> 00:04:13,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be shy.</font>

48
00:04:14,470 --> 00:04:15,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're all adults here.</font>

49
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We just want to print</font>

50
00:04:18,310 --> 00:04:19,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some erotic magazines.</font>

51
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:20,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you print them?</font>

52
00:04:21,830 --> 00:04:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

53
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How big is your order?</font>

54
00:04:24,190 --> 00:04:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our factory is very big.</font>

55
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:27,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

56
00:04:28,830 --> 00:04:29,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our order is big too.</font>

57
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao, ordinary small factories</font>

58
00:04:33,430 --> 00:04:34,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can't handle</font>

59
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our kind of business.</font>

60
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I know</font>

61
00:04:36,950 --> 00:04:38,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your factory is quite capable.</font>

62
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why I came to you.</font>

63
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:43,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, can you do it?</font>

64
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you can do it,</font>

65
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">money is no issue.</font>

66
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A big order, high profit, right?</font>

67
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:51,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And it has to be in color.</font>

68
00:04:56,510 --> 00:04:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a local number,</font>

69
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:02,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but your accent tells me</font>

70
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're from Taiwan, China.</font>

71
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, we're businessmen
from Taiwan, China.</font>

72
00:05:08,750 --> 00:05:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao, relax.</font>

73
00:05:10,750 --> 00:05:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've lived on the mainland for years.</font>

74
00:05:12,510 --> 00:05:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We know the market well.</font>

75
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it works for you,</font>

76
00:05:15,630 --> 00:05:16,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's set a time.</font>

77
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, then.</font>

78
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's the plan. Wait for my call.</font>

79
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll set the time and place.</font>

80
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll talk in person.</font>

81
00:05:25,630 --> 00:05:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then it's a deal.</font>

82
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qiang introduced him?</font>

83
00:05:32,750 --> 00:05:33,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A guy from Taiwan, China?</font>

84
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:33,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

85
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look into him.</font>

86
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:44,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang.</font>

87
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:51,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still, my master's the best.</font>

88
00:05:55,430 --> 00:05:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The thing you asked for.</font>

89
00:05:58,680 --> 00:05:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember:</font>

90
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once the target is confirmed,</font>

91
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">signal at once and move in.</font>

92
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:05,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see.</font>

93
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, what's the password?</font>

94
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your birthday.</font>

95
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, what about that one?</font>

96
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're asking me?</font>

97
00:06:24,950 --> 00:06:26,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whose stupid idea was this?</font>

98
00:06:27,310 --> 00:06:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ask whoever came up with it.</font>

99
00:06:28,870 --> 00:06:30,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only care about results.</font>

100
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you have a plan?</font>

101
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let's go with your plan for now.</font>

102
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:35,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anything goes wrong,
I'll hold you accountable.</font>

103
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. I'll handle it myself.</font>

104
00:06:37,830 --> 00:06:38,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

105
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:40,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

106
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:43,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anything happens,
don't call the station.</font>

107
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Call Jin at the newsstand by the gate.</font>

108
00:06:45,630 --> 00:06:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay calm.</font>

109
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:47,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't force it.</font>

110
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:49,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And keep yourself safe.</font>

111
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where would I get that?</font>

112
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must have one.</font>

113
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really don't.</font>

114
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't, but your station does.</font>

115
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't care.</font>

116
00:07:09,430 --> 00:07:11,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I even got you something
that's hard to find.</font>

117
00:07:11,070 --> 00:07:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Figure it out yourself.</font>

118
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How shameless.</font>

119
00:07:14,510 --> 00:07:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, fine.</font>

120
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll figure something out.</font>

121
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get me a gun.</font>

122
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is no joke.</font>

123
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An operation like this can't have guns.</font>

124
00:07:21,830 --> 00:07:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not joking.</font>

125
00:07:23,270 --> 00:07:24,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who knows what kind of trouble</font>

126
00:07:24,430 --> 00:07:25,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this mission will stir up?</font>

127
00:07:29,310 --> 00:07:29,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In that case,</font>

128
00:07:30,270 --> 00:07:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll think it over.</font>

129
00:07:32,310 --> 00:07:34,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll prepare some secret weapons, okay?</font>

130
00:07:35,870 --> 00:07:36,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm leaving.</font>

131
00:07:38,390 --> 00:07:40,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make that box look classier.</font>

132
00:07:40,830 --> 00:07:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Off you go.</font>

133
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must have one at home.</font>

134
00:07:43,950 --> 00:07:44,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really don't.</font>

135
00:07:50,110 --> 00:07:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Strive hard in success and failure♪</font>

136
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:56,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With ambition,
one should not fear being late♪</font>

137
00:07:58,470 --> 00:08:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪It's okay that no one notices me♪</font>

138
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Achievement relies on real skill♪</font>

139
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:09,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Be a true man♪</font>

140
00:08:10,930 --> 00:08:13,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bear the pain and disappointment♪</font>

141
00:08:16,130 --> 00:08:18,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Devotion requires my willingness♪</font>

142
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Give my all to what must be done♪</font>

143
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Who fakes sincerity with hostility♪</font>

144
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:30,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Just act, no need for many excuses♪</font>

145
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪What's charming is this bond♪</font>

146
00:08:36,590 --> 00:08:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Who hasn't had sad memories♪</font>

147
00:08:41,790 --> 00:08:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen,</font>

148
00:08:43,030 --> 00:08:45,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao has been waiting upstairs.</font>

149
00:08:45,390 --> 00:08:46,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way, please.</font>

150
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:52,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No need to make me explain♪</font>

151
00:08:53,970 --> 00:08:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Heroes may just be madmen♪</font>

152
00:08:59,420 --> 00:09:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's be men of courage♪</font>

153
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:03,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Willing to venture into the world♪</font>

154
00:09:03,780 --> 00:09:07,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Creating a moving story
with my own hands♪</font>

155
00:09:08,090 --> 00:09:10,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more hesitation
in success or failure♪</font>

156
00:09:10,290 --> 00:09:12,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With my true heart and sincerity♪</font>

157
00:09:12,380 --> 00:09:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Chasing ambitiously
in the competitive circle♪</font>

158
00:09:21,750 --> 00:09:22,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao.</font>

159
00:09:26,790 --> 00:09:28,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, hello, gentlemen.</font>

160
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:30,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jian.</font>

161
00:09:30,750 --> 00:09:32,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you take good care of our guests?</font>

162
00:09:32,550 --> 00:09:34,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything's arranged.</font>

163
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:36,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The usual, okay?</font>

164
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry about that.</font>

165
00:09:42,670 --> 00:09:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

166
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come, come.</font>

167
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen, sit over here.</font>

168
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, come on.</font>

169
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:48,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ladies, ladies.</font>

170
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on. Sit, sit.</font>

171
00:09:51,550 --> 00:09:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

172
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two are so young.</font>

173
00:09:55,910 --> 00:09:57,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing as I expected.</font>

174
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Being young means daring to dream
and take risks.</font>

175
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:01,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well said.</font>

176
00:10:01,630 --> 00:10:02,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a young guy too.</font>

177
00:10:03,150 --> 00:10:04,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How should I address you two?</font>

178
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jason Yang]
Taipei Haoyun Trading Group.</font>

179
