<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me inject it.</font>

361
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll get it after me.</font>

362
00:20:05,590 --> 00:20:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's be happy and joyful, okay?</font>

363
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:07,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't do that.</font>

364
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:08,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've never tried it?</font>

365
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:08,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

366
00:20:09,790 --> 00:20:11,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone has a first time. Come on.</font>

367
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:12,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

368
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really can't.</font>

369
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:14,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't.</font>

370
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:15,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's my second time.</font>

371
00:20:15,680 --> 00:20:16,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, hurry.</font>

372
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't dare.</font>

373
00:20:17,350 --> 00:20:17,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't dare?</font>

374
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:19,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sure?</font>

375
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:22,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then just do as I say.</font>

376
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:25,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">About tonight,</font>

377
00:20:25,750 --> 00:20:27,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't say anything.</font>

378
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't have to do anything.</font>

379
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just go take a shower.</font>

380
00:20:31,270 --> 00:20:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then, you can leave.</font>

381
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll get every cent.</font>

382
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's that?</font>

383
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:37,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

384
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:38,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. Go.</font>

385
00:20:57,550 --> 00:21:00,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss, your bag.</font>

386
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember:</font>

387
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:06,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't tell anyone about tonight.</font>

388
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:09,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Close the door.</font>

389
00:21:49,030 --> 00:21:50,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Babe.</font>

390
00:21:50,480 --> 00:21:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You stayed here all night?</font>

391
00:21:52,350 --> 00:21:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao told me</font>

392
00:21:53,550 --> 00:21:56,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to take good care of you two.</font>

393
00:21:57,310 --> 00:21:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That girl was a pain.</font>

394
00:21:59,550 --> 00:22:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She didn't have the kind</font>

395
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of feeling I wanted.</font>

396
00:22:02,750 --> 00:22:03,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro.</font>

397
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:05,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry about that.</font>

398
00:22:06,960 --> 00:22:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, thanks for last night.</font>

399
00:22:09,590 --> 00:22:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's what I'm here for.</font>

400
00:22:11,350 --> 00:22:13,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come find me again next time.</font>

401
00:22:13,030 --> 00:22:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For sure, only you.</font>

402
00:22:17,960 --> 00:22:19,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You jerk.</font>

403
00:22:19,070 --> 00:22:20,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You kept her here all night?</font>

404
00:22:22,550 --> 00:22:25,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm hungry. Let's get ready and eat.</font>

405
00:22:28,550 --> 00:22:28,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro.</font>

406
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:44,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You actually slept with her?</font>

407
00:22:44,310 --> 00:22:45,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you talking about?</font>

408
00:22:45,440 --> 00:22:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't play dumb with me.</font>

409
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:47,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you or didn't you?</font>

410
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a mistake.</font>

411
00:22:49,350 --> 00:22:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's human nature.</font>

412
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:51,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is that a mistake?</font>

413
00:22:51,070 --> 00:22:51,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd better come clean.</font>

414
00:22:52,550 --> 00:22:54,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't try
your interrogation tricks on me.</font>

415
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You looked so impressive
charging in yesterday.</font>

416
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao.</font>

417
00:22:57,640 --> 00:22:59,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen.</font>

418
00:23:00,550 --> 00:23:01,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen.</font>

419
00:23:01,960 --> 00:23:02,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao.</font>

420
00:23:02,640 --> 00:23:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen.</font>

421
00:23:03,550 --> 00:23:04,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good morning.</font>

422
00:23:04,310 --> 00:23:05,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Morning, morning. So, how was it?</font>

423
00:23:05,720 --> 00:23:06,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Last night, that girl...</font>

424
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:09,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad, huh?</font>

425
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:10,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're a good brother.</font>

426
00:23:11,070 --> 00:23:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

427
00:23:11,720 --> 00:23:12,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

428
00:23:12,440 --> 00:23:14,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's go have morning tea</font>

429
00:23:14,350 --> 00:23:15,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then get ready
to head to the factory</font>

430
00:23:16,030 --> 00:23:16,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the island.</font>

431
00:23:18,350 --> 00:23:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On the island?</font>

432
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:22,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is our responsibility.</font>

433
00:23:23,720 --> 00:23:25,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But rest assured, both of you.</font>

434
00:23:25,440 --> 00:23:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An officer went with him.</font>

435
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:29,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu shouldn't be in danger.</font>

436
00:23:29,590 --> 00:23:31,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officers mean no danger?</font>

437
00:23:31,310 --> 00:23:32,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't Ouyang Xu already</font>

438
00:23:32,310 --> 00:23:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">vanish right under your noses?</font>

439
00:23:34,030 --> 00:23:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes. That was my mistake.</font>

440
00:23:36,510 --> 00:23:37,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But what matters more now</font>

441
00:23:37,510 --> 00:23:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is finding a solution.</font>

442
00:23:39,350 --> 00:23:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suggest we don't alert them.</font>

443
00:23:41,510 --> 00:23:43,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise,
all our arrangements are wasted.</font>

444
00:23:43,350 --> 00:23:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which matters more, the case or the man?</font>

445
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:46,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang,
you give us a suggestion, then.</font>

446
00:23:46,830 --> 00:23:48,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just think we shouldn't overreact.</font>

447
00:23:48,790 --> 00:23:50,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can I not be nervous?</font>

448
00:23:50,270 --> 00:23:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's true that Ouyang Xu
is your apprentice,</font>

449
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but he's not a child.</font>

450
00:23:52,830 --> 00:23:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And there's a cop with him.</font>

451
00:23:54,750 --> 00:23:55,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then what do we do?</font>

452
00:23:55,590 --> 00:23:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Search the whole city?</font>

453
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:56,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And drop the case?</font>

454
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:00,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Zhao, you tell us.</font>

455
00:24:00,750 --> 00:24:02,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Tax Bureau is taking the lead,
after all.</font>

456
00:24:05,200 --> 00:24:05,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Luo,</font>

457
00:24:05,830 --> 00:24:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that's not quite right.</font>

458
00:24:07,350 --> 00:24:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter who leads,</font>

459
00:24:08,440 --> 00:24:10,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's a joint investigation.</font>

460
00:24:10,720 --> 00:24:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang, sit down.</font>

461
00:24:13,590 --> 00:24:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit.</font>

462
00:24:17,830 --> 00:24:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu is your apprentice,</font>

463
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:21,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">which makes him our colleague
at the Tax Bureau.</font>

464
00:24:22,240 --> 00:24:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, as the director,</font>

465
00:24:23,640 --> 00:24:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want anything to happen to him.</font>

466
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I believe nothing will.</font>

467
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What Chief Luo said was right.</font>

468
00:24:31,160 --> 00:24:32,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you act rashly now,</font>

469
00:24:32,400 --> 00:24:33,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll likely alert them.</font>

470
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:34,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All our work would be wasted.</font>

471
00:24:35,070 --> 00:24:36,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And it would put them in more danger.</font>

472
00:24:37,030 --> 00:24:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I trust</font>

473
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in Ouyang Xu's ability to adapt.</font>

474
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:42,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's give them a little more time.</font>

475
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:44,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang.</font>

476
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

477
00:24:45,160 --> 00:24:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got a bit worked up just now.</font>

478
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:48,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.
We'll do everything we can to find them.</font>

479
00:24:50,880 --> 00:24:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please.</font>

480
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:52,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's our duty.</font>

481
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

482
00:25:57,030 --> 00:25:58,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was a bit thrilling.</font>

483
00:26:36,750 --> 00:26:37,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao.</font>

484
00:26:39,350 --> 00:26:40,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

485
00:26:40,590 --> 00:26:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

486
00:26:50,030 --> 00:26:50,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Boss.</font>

487
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:56,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Liu.</font>

488
00:26:58,480 --> 00:26:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just got here?</font>

489
00:26:59,510 --> 00:27:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The boat was a bit slow.</font>

490
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:02,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These two are my honored guests.</font>

491
00:27:02,920 --> 00:27:04,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Zhao, Mr. Yang.</font>

492
00:27:04,030 --> 00:27:04,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guests from Taiwan, China.</font>

493
00:27:05,270 --> 00:27:06,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello!</font>

494
00:27:07,590 --> 00:27:08,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome, welcome. Let's go.</font>

495
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:11,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is the car ready?</font>

496
00:27:15,070 --> 00:27:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry. Let's go.</font>

497
00:27:16,640 --> 00:27:17,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

498
00:27:19,960 --> 00:27:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Slow down.</font>

499
00:27:22,510 --> 00:27:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way.</font>

500
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:26,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, watch your step.</font>

501
00:28:38,110 --> 00:28:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, what do you two think?</font>

502
00:28:40,030 --> 00:28:41,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My factory is quite large.</font>

503
00:28:42,070 --> 00:28:42,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come, come.</font>

504
00:28:42,680 --> 00:28:43,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- This way, please.
- Mao.</font>

505
00:28:44,400 --> 00:28:45,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such a big factory.</font>

506
00:28:46,070 --> 00:28:47,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of orders do you usually take?</font>

507
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything profitable.</font>

508
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:51,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.
There's nothing we can't print.</font>

509
00:28:51,790 --> 00:28:53,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you print banknotes?</font>

510
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:56,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, you're joking.</font>

511
00:28:56,270 --> 00:28:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Printing that would get me shot.</font>

512
00:28:58,240 --> 00:28:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But your business</font>

513
00:28:59,240 --> 00:29:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is profitable.</font>

514
00:29:00,550 --> 00:29:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not greedy.</font>

515
00:29:02,110 --> 00:29:04,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come. This is our staff dormitory.</font>

516
00:29:04,350 --> 00:29:05,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come, come.</font>

517
00:29:07,310 --> 00:29:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please come in.</font>

518
00:29:08,790 --> 00:29:09,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The environment is pretty nice.</font>

519
00:29:09,830 --> 00:29:10,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, Zhao.</font>

520
00:29:11,270 --> 00:29:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in and sit.</font>

521
00:29:12,110 --> 00:29:12,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have a seat.</font>

522
00:29:13,750 --> 00:29:14,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a bit messy.</font>

523
00:29:19,240 --> 00:29:19,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come.</font>

524
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:21,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two rest for a bit.</font>

525
00:29:21,550 --> 00:29:22,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go find Mr. Zhou.</font>

526
00:29:22,830 --> 00:29:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a professional.</font>

527
00:29:23,920 --> 00:29:24,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He'll talk with you.</font>

528
00:29:25,880 --> 00:29:26,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so late.</font>

529
00:29:27,030 --> 00:29:28,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about we rest first?</font>

530
00:29:28,880 --> 00:29:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's no problem.</font>

531
00:29:30,110 --> 00:29:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Time is money.</font>

532
00:29:31,720 --> 00:29:32,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we finish tonight,</font>

533
00:29:32,790 --> 00:29:33,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can start tomorrow.</font>

534
00:29:35,200 --> 00:29:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way,</font>

535
00:29:35,790 --> 00:29:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's pitch black outside.</font>

536
00:29:37,160 --> 00:29:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't wander around.</font>

537
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:39,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You could fall off the cliff.</font>

538
00:29:39,440 --> 00:29:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful.</font>

539
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li.</font>

540
00:29:43,750 --> 00:29:45,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's only one bed.</font>

541
00:29:45,480 --> 00:29:47,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are two men supposed to sleep here?</font>

542
00:29:48,440 --> 00:29:49,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry, sorry.</font>

543
00:29:50,110 --> 00:29:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This factory has limited facilities.</font>

544
00:29:52,240 --> 00:29:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There aren't enough dorm beds.</font>

545
00:29:53,790 --> 00:29:55,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tonight, I'll give you two</font>

546
00:29:55,590 --> 00:29:56,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my luxury suite.</font>

547
00:29:56,720 --> 00:29:57,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just make do.</font>

548
00:29:58,070 --> 00:29:58,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go find Mr. Zhou.</font>

549
00:29:59,110 --> 00:30:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it that urgent? What for?</font>

550
00:30:00,440 --> 00:30:01,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two rest.</font>

551
00:30:01,110 --> 00:30:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go find Mr. Zhou.</font>

552
00:30:34,550 --> 00:30:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something's definitely wrong here.</font>

553
00:30:36,350 --> 00:30:37,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They took our cell phones,</font>

554
00:30:38,070 --> 00:30:39,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">cutting us off from the outside.</font>

555
00:30:40,590 --> 00:30:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suspect this is the hideout.</font>

556
00:30:42,680 --> 00:30:44,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But this place is so big.</font>

557
00:30:44,720 --> 00:30:46,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where do we start?</font>

558
00:30:46,680 --> 00:30:47,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Materials, machines.</font>

559
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need a chance to check them all.</font>

560
00:30:49,640 --> 00:30:51,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The most important thing
is the electrotype plate.</font>

561
00:30:51,830 --> 00:30:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The electrotype plate.</font>

562
00:30:53,510 --> 00:30:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to think carefully</font>

563
00:30:55,310 --> 00:30:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about where they'd hide the plate.</font>

564
00:30:57,920 --> 00:30:59,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since we're already on the island,</font>

565
00:30:59,440 --> 00:31:00,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we need to catch them red-handed.</font>

566
00:31:01,550 --> 00:31:03,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to nail down the evidence.</font>

567
00:31:04,680 --> 00:31:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you call that
in your line of work?</font>

568
00:31:07,070 --> 00:31:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An ironclad case?</font>

569
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:11,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's called irrefutable evidence.</font>

570
00:31:13,000 --> 00:31:14,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Irrefutable evidence.</font>

571
00:31:20,110 --> 00:31:21,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One sleeps at the head of the bed,</font>

572
00:31:21,110 --> 00:31:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and one at the foot.</font>

573
00:31:25,350 --> 00:31:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One sleeps inside,</font>

574
00:31:26,640 --> 00:31:27,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and one outside.</font>

575
00:31:29,880 --> 00:31:31,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You brat.</font>

576
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang.</font>

577
00:31:39,350 --> 00:31:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Born in 1958, Year of the Dog.</font>

578
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was born in the Year of the Tiger.</font>

579
00:31:47,830 --> 00:31:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was about to give you a raise.</font>

580
00:31:49,640 --> 00:31:50,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why run?</font>

581
00:31:51,790 --> 00:31:52,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Liu.</font>

582
00:31:53,920 --> 00:31:56,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give you all my wages.</font>

583
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you let me go?</font>

584
00:31:59,590 --> 00:32:00,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've done everything</font>

585
00:32:00,590 --> 00:32:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I promised you.</font>

586
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You tried to run the night before last.</font>

587
00:32:06,310 --> 00:32:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm kind-hearted.</font>

588
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't bring myself to expose you.</font>

589
00:32:09,920 --> 00:32:10,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And tonight, you tried again.</font>

590
00:32:11,070 --> 00:32:11,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

591
00:32:13,110 --> 00:32:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't push your luck.</font>

592
00:32:14,160 --> 00:32:15,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've done the things</font>

593
00:32:15,270 --> 00:32:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I promised Ahong.</font>

594
00:32:16,920 --> 00:32:18,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong promised me.</font>

595
00:32:19,350 --> 00:32:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

596
00:32:20,200 --> 00:32:21,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me call Ahong, please?</font>

597
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong promised me</font>

598
00:32:24,720 --> 00:32:27,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that when I'm done,
she'll send me to Hong Kong, China.</font>

599
00:32:27,070 --> 00:32:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to leave by speedboat?</font>

600
00:32:32,590 --> 00:32:33,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That could work.</font>

601
00:32:34,510 --> 00:32:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me call Ahong.</font>

602
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to bother Ahong.</font>

603
00:32:37,550 --> 00:32:39,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm in charge here.</font>

604
00:32:41,200 --> 00:32:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

605
00:32:42,110 --> 00:32:43,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to call Ahong.</font>

606
00:32:43,590 --> 00:32:44,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me call her.</font>

607
00:32:44,070 --> 00:32:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not comfortable, huh?</font>

608
00:32:46,480 --> 00:32:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come.</font>

609
00:32:47,440 --> 00:32:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me change your position.</font>

610
00:32:52,200 --> 00:32:53,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I forgot to tell you.</font>

611
00:32:53,830 --> 00:32:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know what this printing factory</font>

612
00:32:54,960 --> 00:32:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">used to be?</font>

613
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:57,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A slaughterhouse.</font>

614
00:32:57,550 --> 00:32:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't think I don't know</font>

615
00:32:58,550 --> 00:32:59,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what kind of factory yours is.</font>

616
00:33:00,070 --> 00:33:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know better than I do</font>

617
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:02,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">where Hu went.</font>

618
00:33:03,110 --> 00:33:04,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is still uncomfortable?</font>

619
00:33:04,680 --> 00:33:05,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let's try another.</font>

620
00:33:06,070 --> 00:33:07,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

621
00:33:07,960 --> 00:33:09,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know. I don't know.</font>

622
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:12,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll say it once more:</font>

623
00:33:12,720 --> 00:33:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm in charge of this factory.</font>

624
00:33:15,440 --> 00:33:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understand?</font>

625
00:33:24,550 --> 00:33:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, Liu!</font>

626
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me out!</font>

627
00:33:26,750 --> 00:33:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to call Li Ahong!</font>

628
00:33:28,510 --> 00:33:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then call her.</font>

629
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:30,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

630
00:33:30,680 --> 00:33:31,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Somebody!</font>

631
00:33:32,110 --> 00:33:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help!</font>

632
00:33:52,550 --> 00:33:53,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry, sir.</font>

633
00:33:54,510 --> 00:33:55,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so late,</font>

634
00:33:55,750 --> 00:33:57,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I made you come all this way.</font>

635
00:33:58,310 --> 00:34:01,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just meant to run around.</font>

636
00:34:01,680 --> 00:34:03,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't we agree</font>

637
00:34:03,790 --> 00:34:05,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not to meet unless necessary?</font>

638
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:07,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something important must have come up.</font>

639
00:34:12,150 --> 00:34:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here are this month's accounts.
Please take a look.</font>

640
00:34:36,880 --> 00:34:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I love watching you work the abacus.</font>

641
00:34:40,190 --> 00:34:42,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't get used to calculators.</font>

642
00:34:42,480 --> 00:34:43,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This feels better.</font>

643
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't call me here so late</font>

644
00:34:46,320 --> 00:34:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just about these accounts, right?</font>

645
00:34:52,360 --> 00:34:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've heard some rumors lately.</font>

646
00:34:54,760 --> 00:34:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many years will Lin Jianye get?</font>

647
00:34:57,480 --> 00:34:58,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The maximum.</font>

648
00:34:58,840 --> 00:34:59,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The maximum?</font>

649
00:35:00,150 --> 00:35:01,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That means death.</font>

650
00:35:05,630 --> 00:35:06,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then what about me?</font>

651
00:35:07,030 --> 00:35:08,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut the factory down for now.</font>

652
00:35:08,590 --> 00:35:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lie low until this blows over.</font>

653
00:35:10,550 --> 00:35:11,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The losses would be too great.</font>

654
00:35:12,190 --> 00:35:13,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Slow and steady.</font>

655
00:35:14,280 --> 00:35:15,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as the people are here,</font>

656
00:35:15,960 --> 00:35:17,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the machines can run.</font>

657
00:35:17,480 --> 00:35:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the people are gone,</font>

658
00:35:19,630 --> 00:35:20,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the machines are useless.</font>

659
00:35:22,110 --> 00:35:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about the goods in the warehouse?</font>

660
00:35:23,360 --> 00:35:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Burn them.</font>

661
00:35:32,400 --> 00:35:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right.</font>

662
00:35:33,590 --> 00:35:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This month's accounts</font>

663
00:35:35,280 --> 00:35:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are short by 446,782 yuan</font>

664
00:35:39,360 --> 00:35:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and 33 fen.</font>

665
00:35:41,280 --> 00:35:41,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm leaving.</font>

666
00:35:55,760 --> 00:35:56,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, Ahong.</font>

667
00:35:57,480 --> 00:35:58,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you?</font>

668
00:35:59,030 --> 00:36:00,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm at the factory.</font>

669
00:36:00,590 --> 00:36:01,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell Liu Bingren</font>

670
00:36:02,070 --> 00:36:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to stop work and seal off the island.</font>

671
00:36:03,190 --> 00:36:04,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one in or out.</font>

672
00:36:04,800 --> 00:36:06,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Burn all the goods in the warehouse.</font>

673
00:36:08,800 --> 00:36:09,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

674
00:36:10,110 --> 00:36:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did something happen?</font>

675
00:36:11,590 --> 00:36:12,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just do it.</font>

676
00:36:13,320 --> 00:36:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just said no one in or out.</font>

677
00:36:16,590 --> 00:36:17,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does that include me?</font>

678
00:36:17,840 --> 00:36:18,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Including you.</font>

679
00:36:31,550 --> 00:36:32,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, Mom.</font>

680
00:36:32,800 --> 00:36:34,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong, where are you now?</font>

681
00:36:35,360 --> 00:36:37,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much do you owe them?</font>

682
00:36:37,150 --> 00:36:38,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They've come to our house.</font>

683
00:36:39,000 --> 00:36:40,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go beg Ahong.</font>

684
00:36:40,280 --> 00:36:41,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ask her to cover it for now.</font>

685
00:36:41,550 --> 00:36:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong.</font>

686
00:36:42,590 --> 00:36:43,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They said</font>

687
00:36:43,510 --> 00:36:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that if you don't pay up,</font>

688
00:36:46,590 --> 00:36:48,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have to take something
off your mother.</font>

689
00:36:48,800 --> 00:36:50,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no. Please, Tou.</font>

690
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:52,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's the only family I have.</font>

691
00:36:52,360 --> 00:36:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have</font>

692
00:36:53,440 --> 00:36:55,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a reputation in Chunjiang.</font>

693
00:36:55,190 --> 00:36:55,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not so broke</font>

694
00:36:55,840 --> 00:36:57,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I can't come up with 300,000.</font>

695
00:36:57,230 --> 00:36:58,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three hundred thousand?</font>

696
00:36:59,800 --> 00:37:00,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't count the interest, did you?</font>

697
00:37:01,320 --> 00:37:02,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's six hundred thousand now.</font>

698
00:37:03,400 --> 00:37:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen carefully.</font>

699
00:37:05,800 --> 00:37:07,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't pay up soon,</font>

700
00:37:08,670 --> 00:37:10,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take your mother away.</font>

701
00:37:14,230 --> 00:37:14,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Six hundred thousand.</font>

702
00:37:18,550 --> 00:37:20,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Six hundred thousand.
Six hundred thousand!</font>

703
00:37:37,230 --> 00:37:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liu.</font>

704
00:37:39,440 --> 00:37:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong, have you eaten?</font>

705
00:37:41,400 --> 00:37:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you crazy?</font>

706
00:37:42,320 --> 00:37:43,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why lock him up?</font>

707
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:44,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How am I supposed
to explain this to Ahong?</font>

708
00:37:45,190 --> 00:37:46,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get lost!</font>

709
00:37:47,030 --> 00:37:47,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get lost.</font>

710
00:37:57,880 --> 00:37:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li.</font>

711
00:37:58,880 --> 00:37:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li.</font>

712
00:37:59,920 --> 00:38:01,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, let me go.</font>

713
00:38:01,190 --> 00:38:01,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang.</font>

714
00:38:03,590 --> 00:38:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me. Things were fine.</font>

715
00:38:06,070 --> 00:38:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you run?</font>

716
00:38:08,070 --> 00:38:08,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li.</font>

717
00:38:09,110 --> 00:38:11,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've done everything I was supposed to.</font>

718
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just let me go.</font>

719
00:38:13,510 --> 00:38:14,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li.</font>

720
00:38:14,590 --> 00:38:15,260
